  <item>
    <title>宝可梦的30周年就这么过去了？｜集换电波 Vol.64</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae2023397726cd467593d45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae2023397726cd467593d45</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:27:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>10月的闲聊节目来了。宝可梦30周年似乎已经归于平静，所有的玩家都能享受的周年产品。敢于舍弃的公司才能拥有未来；游戏王WCS奖杯帅出天际，但选手们都在倒卖奖品，TCG的比赛到底给什么样的奖品合适？符文战场一弹里塞了超多惊喜，联动周杰伦品牌是否能进一步拉高收藏价值？请听这一期的集换电波！</span></p><p><span>（注：本期节目录制后，符文战场联动的剑圣卡牌更新了全新的卡框）</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>本期亮点：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>宝可梦30周年相当平稳</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a></span></strong><span> TCG的比赛应该发什么样的奖品</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>游戏王漫画卡太好看了</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>符文战场要出电子版吗</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a></span></strong><span> 顶罕卡竟然是张战场牌</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3462">57:42</a></span></strong><span> PSA积存快速清理中</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">61:23</a></span></strong><span> 万智牌聚光灯开赛在即</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>BIN：普通的TCG玩家，没事打打万智牌</span></p></li><li><p><span>好人：游戏王查卡器、决斗都市、集换社创始人</span></p></li><li><p><span>铁耙：自称普通牌手，实则游戏王高手</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
