  </item>
  <item>
    <title>全程干货！如何靠单卡的交易来支撑一家卡牌店？｜集换电波 Vol.62</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab0efc993d5eb3bdc78b6b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab0efc993d5eb3bdc78b6b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 08:57:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和店家面对面的节目回来了，这一期我们请到了来自贵阳平价卡牌的老板无忧，一个坚决不玩游戏王的店家。相信有很多店家在涉及到单卡的交易时都会陷入艰难的困境：庞大的单卡库存到底要如何管理？怎么平衡卖卡盒和做单卡的利润？为什么说收卡店就是在收对方的库存？这期超长节目为您一次性解答！</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>本期亮点：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 开卡牌店的发端</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 单卡仓储管理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">67:15</a> 线上店和线下店的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5307">88:27</a> 单店收购</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6027">100:27</a> 如何管理单卡卡价</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7283">121:23</a> 新时代的卡店形态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8103">135:03</a> 爱好与生意&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>好人：游戏王查卡器、决斗都市、集换社创始人</span></p></li><li><p><span>铁耙：自称普通牌手，实则游戏王高手</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>特约嘉宾：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>无忧：平价卡牌老板</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6678d923d3fc5dd6278b7704/lhVKyvuz-GK0yOB8Uw7t_khfDbIi.m4a" length="143549060" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:27:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuhb9Dym7y2rFlJZlXkBcjEIKaEm.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
