    <title>30周年，宝可梦卡牌是怎么一点点发展到现在的｜集换电波 Vol.50</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d50dfbe2c8be31559b19dd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d50dfbe2c8be31559b19dd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 14:26:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>作为毫无疑问的当世第一TCG品牌，宝可梦诞生至今已有30年的时光。在这30年的发展历程里，PTCG有过低谷，也有过高光。从开始的尝试性作品，到乘着收藏与拍卖的风飞上高峰，可能在无数看似理性的分析与解读背后，我们都忽略了宝可梦这家公司背后对品牌运营一直坚持的东西——纯真与爱。这一期节目，我们邀请到了收藏卡顾问KB，让他带着我们一同回顾宝可梦走来的这30年的。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期亮点：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a> </span></strong><span>PTCG的开端</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a></span></strong><span> 98年宝可梦动画开播</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> </span></strong><span>宝可梦公司回收版权</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> </span></strong><span>更改宝可梦卡牌样式</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a></span></strong><span> 宝可梦卡牌的黑暗时期</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3854">64:14</a></span></strong><span> 宝可梦游戏的中文版请愿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4813">80:13</a></span></strong><span> 疫情与评级卡的时代</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5891">98:11</a></span></strong><span> PTCG简中突然到来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6908">115:08</a></span></strong><span> 宝可梦的30周年</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8054">134:14</a></span></strong><span> 什么是正确的买卡心态</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8540">142:20</a></span></strong><span> 宝可梦高层的热爱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>好人：游戏王查卡器、决斗都市、集换社创始人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>KB：集换社收藏顾问，白龙姬背后的男人</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
